"use strict";(self.webpackChunk_N_E=self.webpackChunk_N_E||[]).push([[88098],{88098:function(t){t.exports=JSON.parse('{"content":"\\n<center>\\n<RestaurantCard\\n  cover=\\"/assets/snippets/location/2712aa0de3610f92fa724082aed259cc.jpg\\"\\n  title=\\"Blanco Court Prawn Mee\\"\\n  cuisine=\\"Noodles\\"\\n  address=\\"243 Beach Rd, #01-01, Singapore 189754\\"\\n  rating=4\\n  tags=\\"restaurant\\"\\n/>\\n</center>\\n\\n## Review\\nI went early and fortunately was able to eat right away without waiting.  \\nThe interior might look a bit unhygienic and hot, which could be off-putting, but since it\'s a famous spot, I went in without hesitation.  \\n\\nThe broth might seem light at first, but it\'s rich with a deep prawn flavor.  \\nI really enjoyed it.  \\n\\nYou have to pay in cash, and I recommend ordering a juice from the separate stall next to the ordering counter.  \\n## Pictures\\n<pictures>\\n<img src=\\"/assets/snippets/location/6872bc7cf202991c1d703dec4dd4bf4c.jpg\\" style=\\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; object-fit: contain;\\" alt=\\"Blanco Court Prawn Mee\\">\\n<img src=\\"/assets/snippets/location/017ef5d811ac8f626e2039f480bebcc9.jpg\\" style=\\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; object-fit: contain;\\" alt=\\"Blanco Court Prawn Mee\\">\\n</pictures>\\n"}')}}]);